# Treat media, document, and font assets as native binary files (no CRLF conversion)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Treat web files as text
*.js text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.jsx text
*.json text
*.css text
*.html text
*.md text
*.svg text
